    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "```suggestion\n    const isWaitingForResponse = status === 'submitted';\n    const isStreamingWithNoContent = status === 'streaming' && !lastPart;\n    const isStreamingNonTextContent =\n      status === 'streaming' && lastPart && !isPartText(lastPart);\n\n    const showLoader =\n      isWaitingForResponse ||\n      isStreamingWithNoContent ||\n      isStreamingNonTextContent;\n```\n\nyour third condition is redundant with the last one as you're checking if it's streaming and the last part is not text, the loader will already show for all tools",
    "commit_id": "be30fb42eecaf255158f04c914bab6f92b370e64",
    "created_at": "2026-03-05T09:06:09Z",
    "diff_hunk": "@@ -325,6 +324,19 @@ export function createChatMessagesComponent({\n       ),\n     };\n \n+    const lastMessage = messages[messages.length - 1];\n+    const lastPart = lastMessage?.parts?.[lastMessage.parts.length - 1];\n+    const showLoader =\n+      status === 'submitted' ||\n+      (status === 'streaming' && !lastPart) ||\n+      // show the loader if the last part is a tool that doesn't have output available yet\n+      (status === 'streaming' &&\n+        lastPart &&\n+        isPartTool(lastPart) &&\n+        lastPart.state !== 'output-available') ||\n+      // show the loader if the last part is text and we're still streaming (i.e. more text is coming)\n+      (status === 'streaming' && lastPart && !isPartText(lastPart));",
